{"title":"Sunday assorted links","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/967489094/0/marginalrevolution~Sunday-assorted-links.html","date":1786289360000,"content":"<p>1. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/05/technology/ai-china-africa.html?smid=nytcore-ios-share\" target=\"_blank\">African use of Chinese AI</a> (NYT).  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/wirecutter/reviews/talenti-investigation/\" target=\"_blank\">what happened to Talenti gelato?</a> (NYT)  And <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/07/world/europe/barbican-london-redevelopment-tower-block.html\" target=\"_blank\">the NIMBY brutalists who live in the Barbican</a> (NYT).</p>\r\n<p>2. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.commonreader.co.uk/p/modernist-gothic-in-copenhagen?utm_source=post-email-title&amp;publication_id=120973&amp;post_id=210092128&amp;utm_campaign=email-post-title&amp;isFreemail=true&amp;r=3o9&amp;triedRedirect=true&amp;utm_medium=email\" target=\"_blank\">Modernist Gothic in Copenhagen</a>.</p>\r\n<p>3. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/tunguz/status/2085179547180548302?s=20\" target=\"_blank\">AI-generated Odyssey in Vietnam</a>.</p>\r\n<p>4. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/sebkrier/status/2085521799656444104\" target=\"_blank\">Questions from Seb Krier</a>.</p>\r\n<p>5. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.theregister.com/ai-and-ml/2026/08/05/time-magazine-has-a-separate-version-of-its-website-with-ads-only-ai-can-see/5283640\" target=\"_blank\">Time magazine has a special version that only the AIs can read</a>.</p>\r\n<p>6. <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/mylovanov/status/20855078049289